thym 1

program bounded-recursion
  why: a move that calls itself once, under the depth it says, and then gives the words of the text.

  takes t: text
  gives n: number

  move again(x: text, more: bool): number
    depth: 2
    if more then
      give again x, false
    else
      give words x
    end
  end

  give again t, true
end
